# DEV/DEMO blocklist — NOT shipped in the production image.
#
# Used only by the dev compose stack (docker-compose.yml) so the demo traffic
# generators produce "blocked" stats on the dashboard, and by tests. The
# production config (configs/mazedns.yaml) ships no blocklist at all.
#
# Mounted into each resolver node and loaded via MAZEDNS_BLOCKLIST_FILES.
0.0.0.0 doubleclick.net
0.0.0.0 googleadservices.com
0.0.0.0 ads.example.com
0.0.0.0 tracking.example.org
